  "footer_blank_columns_note": "the slaves block, the pensioners block, every deaf/dumb/blind/insane column except white 25-and-upwards, every coloured column, and five of the seven schools columns carry no figure at the foot of this sheet and no entry on any of its 30 lines.",
  "footer_total_glyph_note": "the TOTAL footing is three figures. The first is a single slash — this hand's 1. The third carries the top bar drawn to the right and the descender curling left that this hand puts on every 5 (lines 6, 11, 20 and 23 write the same glyph). The second is a closed loop with a tail rising to the upper right — the 6 the hand writes on lines 2, 16, 24 and 25, and not the round 0 it would have to be for 105, nor the matched pair of slashes that would make it a 4. Read 165, and the line-by-line sum of 164 agrees with it to one person."
